          "path": "_m/d/r/5/r/tin-pan-alley-wp/1926-sheet-music-cover-magnoli.png",
          "filename": "1926 Sheet Music Cover \"Magnolia\" from the musical \"My Magnolia\" (Lyrics by Alex C. Rogers and Music by C. Luckey Roberts).png",
          "caption": "This is the cover to a sheet music solo vocal and piano song titled \"Magnolia\" which was one of the music and dance numbers of the musical comedy \"My Magnolia\" written and produced by Alex C. Rogers and C. Luckey Roberts in 1926. \"My Magnolia\" toured on Vaudeville circuits for about 20 weeks then opened 12 July 1926 at the Mansfield Theatre and closed 16 July 1926 after 6 performances. Critics reviewing \"My Magnolia\" loved the \"Magnolia\" number and predicted it would become a popular dance tune. The music was published in 1926 by the Rogers &amp; Roberts publishing company, Suite 309, Navex Building, 225 West 46th Street, New York City, NY.",
          "alt": "This is the cover to a sheet music solo vocal and piano song titled \"Magnolia\" which was one of the music and dance numbers of the musical comedy \"My Magnolia\" written and produced by Alex C. Rogers and C. Luckey Roberts in 1926. \"My Magnolia\" toured on Vaudeville circuits for about 20 weeks then opened 12 July 1926 at the Mansfield Theatre and closed 16 July 1926 after 6 performances. Critics reviewing \"My Magnolia\" loved the \"Magnolia\" number and predicted it would become a popular dance tune. The music was published in 1926 by the Rogers &amp; Roberts publishing company, Suite 309, Navex Building, 225 West 46th Street, New York City, NY.",
          "width": 3670,
          "height": 4886,
          "mimeType": "image/png",
          "license": "Public domain",
          "artist": "Alex C. Rogers and C. Luckey Roberts\n\nRogers &amp; Roberts Publishing Company; Suite 309, Navax Building, 225 West 46th Street, New York City, NY, USA",
          "sourceUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:1926_Sheet_Music_Cover_%22Magnolia%22_from_the_musical_%22My_Magnolia%22_(Lyrics_by_Alex_C._Rogers_and_Music_by_C._Luckey_Roberts).png",
          "sourceType": "commons-category",
